# CODEOWNERS — Bobby ITSM Chatbot
# Defines who must review PRs that touch specific paths.
# GitHub automatically requests reviews from these owners.
#
# Format: <path-pattern>  <@github-username or @org/team>
# ⚠️  Replace @AMIT110409 and team names with your real GitHub handles/teams.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Global fallback — every PR needs at least one review from the project lead
*                                      @AMIT110409

# Infrastructure changes need infra team sign-off
infrastructure/**                      @AMIT110409

# GitHub Actions workflows — only trusted engineers can modify CI/CD
.github/workflows/**                   @AMIT110409

# Backend code — backend team must review
bobby/backend/**                       @AMIT110409

# Frontend code — frontend team must review
bobby/frontend/**                      @AMIT110409

# Security-sensitive files — always need explicit review
bobby/backend/middleware/**            @AMIT110409
bobby/backend/config/settings.py      @AMIT110409
.env.example                           @AMIT110409
